5:["$","p","Moreover, summer programs are a fantastic way to build a global network. The relationships you form with peers, instructors, and professionals can open doors to future opportunities, whether it’s internships, job offers, or collaborative projects. These connections can be invaluable as you navigate your academic and professional journey.",{"children":"Moreover, summer programs are a fantastic way to build a global network. The relationships you form with peers, instructors, and professionals can open doors to future opportunities, whether it’s internships, job offers, or collaborative projects. These connections can be invaluable as you navigate your academic and professional journey."}]
